# Agent model for the AgentDojo runs: qwen3:8b with thinking on.
#   ollama create qwen3-8b-think -f config/ollama/Modelfile.qwen3-8b-think
# A 16K context holds AgentDojo's tool schemas and outputs entirely on a 12 GB GPU (the default
# 40K context spills to the CPU); 4096 new tokens leave room for the reasoning before a tool call.
FROM qwen3:8b
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER num_predict 4096
